; CLOSE-FIGHTER WAVE 1 (sl-0213; variety rule f): THE FLEE-AND-PELT
; SKIRMISHER — the designer's archetype, carried by the goblin ALONE
; (one or a couple of families ever; wave 2 invents fresh). FLANKER
; holds the [3.5, 5.0] band as a JUKING circle (chirality by id
; parity — the proof-warren finding: straight-radial keep-range
; collapsed corridor twins onto ONE point, two shooters one doubled
; shot; the tangent splits them structurally) while the sling pelts
; from the band (trigger floor 2.0 — a pressing goblin commits to
; the jab, never plinks point-blank; the king_grubb pinch finding);
; past 5.0 [T] — THE SET DISTANCE — it spirals in like a chaser;
; when the shiv gate opens (cooldown 300 = the 5 s skirmish clock)
; the press sends it ALL the way in for the jab, then the flee
; resumes. Replaces the sl-0104 rusher-slash chaser (the sl-0208
; whiff class). Lead 12 shiv / 16 pelt, exact. All numbers [T].
; The wolf also rides FLANKER — the POLICY is shared grammar like
; CHASER; the read differs by band and kit (tight lunge-orbit
; biter vs ranged juking plinker) per the variety rule's own terms
; (behavior identity, not enum identity).

